# Local-only override for the DRIVE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY secret, read by
# the Functions emulator (never deployed — see firebase.json's functions
# `ignore` list and .gitignore). Paste the full service-account JSON key
# on one line as the value once you've created one — see docs/SETUP.md.
# Left blank so the emulator boots without an interactive prompt; Drive
# uploads simply fail with a clear error until this is filled in.
DRIVE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY=
